Package: usagestat-bar
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, gjs, gir1.2-soup-3.0, libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), gir1.2-rsvg-2.0, python3, python3-gi, dbus, bash
Recommends: usagestat
Description: shared UsageStat desktop service and preferences
 Displays provider usage through optional desktop panel adapters.
 The independent usagestat CLI is needed to obtain provider usage data.

